    "config": "deploy/e2e/tempo.yaml exactly as committed by this change (metrics_generator.storage.path present); without it the reference answers every TraceQL metrics query with no series at all",
    "how": "standalone container on the host, OTLP/HTTP ingest of one resource per corpus (resource.service.name = the corpus's service), then GET /api/metrics/query_range with step=60s over a window covering the ingest; every corpus lands inside a single occupied step, so the counts below are that step's samples",
    "note": "TraceQL metrics visibility lags search visibility by roughly a minute on this build (the live block has to complete), which is why the harness polls the reference rather than querying it once",
